Subject: Require the upstream Cargo lockfile during CMake builds
Upstream-base: ebd80cac99b48a323200d84365e07a58cc27412d

The port pins nod and its transitive Rust dependency graph. Pass LOCKED to
Corrosion so both cargo metadata and compilation reject dependency resolution
that would change the committed Cargo.lock. The lockfile itself is unchanged.

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -80,5 +80,6 @@
 corrosion_import_crate(
     MANIFEST_PATH "${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/nod-ffi/Cargo.toml"
     CRATES nod-ffi # NOTE: target becomes `nod`
+    LOCKED
     ${NOD_IMPORT_ARGS}
 )
